# React + TypeScript + Vite frontend guidelines và patterns cho QLDSV-HTC

## 🏗️ Architecture
```
@frontend/
├── src/
│   ├── components/     # UI components (common, specific)
│   ├── pages/          # Page components/containers
│   ├── services/       # API services & data fetching
│   ├── hooks/          # Custom React hooks
│   ├── store/          # Global state management
│   ├── utils/          # Utility functions
│   └── types/          # TypeScript interfaces/types
├── .env                # Frontend-specific config
├── package.json        # Dependencies & scripts
└── vite.config.ts      # Vite build configuration
```

## 🔧 Development Workflow
1. **Research** → @DESCRIPTION.md, tham khảo CẢ BA dự án trong `@local/`
2. **Design components** → Atomic Design: atoms → molecules → organisms → pages
3. **Manage state** → React Query (server), Context (global UI), local state
4. **Test & debug** → UI testing trực tiếp, React DevTools

## 🚀 Running the Frontend

### Using Script Architecture (Recommended)
```bash
# Quick start với script architecture
./scripts/start-frontend.sh

# Start với full setup option
./scripts/start-frontend.sh --full-default-setup
```

### Manual Execution
```bash
cd frontend
npm install
npm run dev    # Available at http://localhost:5173
```

### Debug Tools
- Browser DevTools (F12):
  - Console tab: logs & errors
  - Network tab: API calls
  - React DevTools: component tree & props

